      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GRUBBER KICK (7) comes off a (30.01) win last time, scoring by 2 lengths in a Grade 4/5 over 520m at this track. Has already won two times from this draw. Looks a leading chance on best. SUMMER'S DUNAY (2) hit the ground running from an outside draw with a fast early split, holding on for a minor placing when second and beaten 0.8 lengths at this track over 520m in 30.42. Has a solid record from this box including two wins and a minor placing. Hard to beat again. RAZOR HAYZE (8) was strongly supported last start when a short priced favourite and duly saluted winning by 1.3 lengths at this track in a handy 30.14. Draws out wide but goes well over this trip. Has a strong record out of this box with two wins and a minor placing from five starts. Bold showing expected again. ",
